// Scan page Scan Receipt Automatic expense extraction Capture Receipt Upload from Gallery How it works 1. Point your camera at the receipt or upload an image 2. Our OCR technology extracts the data automatically 3. Review and confirms the extracted information 4. The expense is saved to your account
